WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.463
Here's what Learn gives you.

2
00:00:01.463 --> 00:00:04.926
The Create workflow request: a category,

3
00:00:04.926 --> 00:00:08.600
a name, flags, a scope,
a trigger and the tasks.

4
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.150
A changed definition goes to
the create new version action.

5
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.140
Triggers run on the hire date, the
leave date or the creation date,

6
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.850
within a hundred and
eighty days either way.

7
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:22.115
The pass task takes a lifetime
and a one-time-use flag,

8
00:00:22.115 --> 00:00:25.912
and Learn recommends at most
twenty-four hours for a new hire.

9
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:29.445
And execution limits
quarantine a scheduled run,

10
00:00:29.445 --> 00:00:32.350
though a workflow's
limit isn't in the API.
